{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_title", "source_sha256": "42058b8739396b035f597d2dcc7af0504084c33411c36c0c8c4c01975d9fdc08", "ja": "どうせ恋をするのなら", "zh": "既然要谈恋爱的话", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_synopsis", "source_sha256": "952293d1ef022b21e1970ab9c3970faf65c248841de245cf7416e0abd4faf791", "ja": "アイドルの恋について、否定的な朋花。公演\nメンバーからアドバイスを受けた結果、プロ\nデューサーの個人情報を聞き出し、デートを\nする事に。そこで聞かされた言葉に、朋花は\nアイドルである事への決意を新たにする。", "zh": "朋花对偶像恋爱持否定态度。在听取公演\n成员的建议后，她打听出了制作人的\n个人信息，并决定前去约会。而制作人在约会中所说的\n那番话，让朋花更加坚定了身为偶像的决心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1000_p", "source_sha256": "db4c1aa26fde2547e32e86446a042cc2a078a2055ca9cb4a350d1cbf8496bc4a", "ja": "（朋花は恋する気持ちを知るため、まずは\n公演メンバーに、聞き取りを始めたようだ……）", "zh": "（朋花为了了解恋爱的心情，似乎先开始向公演成员们打听了起来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "597cfdd59eed16589b4241e7c879c12bc726347dda38181b45ed260f7d632c27", "ja": "では……恋をすると、どうなるものなんでしょう～？\nみなさんは、どんな気持ちになりますか～？", "zh": "那么……恋爱之后，会变成什么样呢～？\n大家会有怎样的感觉呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "a8565cce00bc9217af44cf4721553a48ddb9bbe48e664e386f864ba94e71538d", "ja": "えーっと……。少女漫画とかだと、\n相手の人のことで頭がいっぱいになったりする！", "zh": "呃……在少女漫画之类的作品里，脑子里会全是那个人的身影！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "ee420e72c5593024f9ff0d7d2088034f97f3e84468b2c10f7f0002fd69788118", "ja": "そうですね。その人の姿を見るだけで、\nドキドキしたり、切なくなったり……。", "zh": "是啊。光是看到那个人的身影，就会心跳加速，甚至感到难过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "2559434ae4949495c5aa040dd20cbfed054820c21e564032c83449937fb407ea", "ja": "苦しい気持ちにもなると思うわ。", "zh": "我想，也会让人感到痛苦吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "7f2f5db10049ef4708ca4aa1ad3249a77a4387129df3cd8c1ff1eaa641ec4d99", "ja": "気持ちを伝えたいけど、知られたくない……\nそういう、葛藤みたいなものもあるんじゃないかしら。", "zh": "虽然想传达自己的心意，却又不想让对方知道……\n是不是也会有这种矛盾的心情呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "2cc47bf497b53ab04930e3e90a7164713105188b2dd0f956946ce059ed44b801", "ja": "恋する気持ちを、相手に知られたくない……。\nそれは、何故でしょう～？", "zh": "不想让对方知道自己恋慕的心情……\n这又是为什么呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "fdd5323716afd553a29ffeffd0393e010ab4f5818574bb414ab22ecd035a349b", "ja": "恋が、成就しなかった時のことを考えて……\nというのが、一番の理由な気がしますね。", "zh": "是考虑到万一恋情没能修成正果……\n我觉得这应该就是最大的理由吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "84ef23eeb7d126c362ddcd89a77b46c7ab46151aa7dfeb037cec2194b068c0f5", "ja": "ギョクサイってやつだね。", "zh": "这就叫玉碎吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1009_002chi", "source_sha256": "b12c544bb365faef795fc70a6c505d484330350d4edffa1e0914287907834836", "ja": "そうね。……そうなってしまうくらいなら、\n知られたくない、と思うのかも。", "zh": "是啊。……如果会变成那样的话，\n或许就不想让对方知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "e3e7d659c68c69dd278579a07c9e2287e4b8dca48ac7be200232d00f5485e18d", "ja": "そんなぁ！　がんばって告白したのに……\nうう、すっごく切ないよ～……！", "zh": "怎么会这样！明明我鼓起勇气告白了……\n呜呜，好难过啊～……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "2c6cf676f596c821ee743807334794042a98955253777f58a5eb7c7793a0838e", "ja": "なるほど……\n恋心というのは、複雑なんですね～。", "zh": "原来如此……\n恋爱之心还真是复杂呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1012_011ami", "source_sha256": "acc0f87fbf8a5b442df952c1022b4fc0f3b5f3970925f919ed253e786450af34", "ja": "でもでも、恋を知る一番の方法は、\nやっぱデートっしょ！", "zh": "不过不过，要了解恋爱，最好的方法果然还是约会嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "a23953ee5d7ad2bf6aae5d54cc511a2da8a7b82e9c0f3ca8a4bfa50d1422b450", "ja": "朋花様も、デートすれば\nドキドキすること間違いなしだよ！", "zh": "朋花大人，去约会的话，\n肯定会心跳加速的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "1358711f1b350f8619d2d582a037e986a3fa16a4ad014980b005a53dfc990a27", "ja": "デートですか～……。\nふむふむ～……。", "zh": "是约会吗～……\n嗯嗯～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "204ef05c73b1312b72dff30ccc49660af9901e0216ee500a4b2718bcd5c7216a", "ja": "みなさん、ありがとうございました～。\nお陰で、とても参考になりましたよ～。", "zh": "谢谢大家啦～。\n托大家的福，非常有参考价值哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "b7936bc813a5616461748df1b43a3949c3ee4f32dd95caf97dfc5d27fb9754fe", "ja": "{$P$}さんにも、\nこの結果を伝えてきますね～。", "zh": "我也去把这个结果告诉{$P$}先生吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5efaebb92251f79567ee936b117072af1331c542bb88531abb3a38cd4060ae1f", "ja": "なるほど……恋をすると、\nその人の事で頭がいっぱいになる、か……。", "zh": "原来如此……坠入爱河后，脑子里就会全是那个人啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "e9f981a53ad7b706fe6404c1e8d85861af574da0055fa78c9923c03b4d7ea8e4", "ja": "ええ。ですが、同時に気付いたんです～。", "zh": "是的。不过，我也同时意识到了一件事～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1019_031tom", "source_sha256": "37679b3e557feb20d6e86ae26623305126ac136031aa9850b546146abaae2ff8", "ja": "私は、そもそも{$P$}さんのことを\nあまりよく知らないのではないか、と。", "zh": "我本来就不太了解{$P$}先生呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1020_p", "source_sha256": "383c7e859a628f4a369f15d572318644eb28ebe4785951b589161034df0ebe3e", "ja": "俺の事……？", "zh": "说的是我……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1021_031tom", "source_sha256": "060e63097edf92b2bf3965524e1a4023028206e83073c9e9f0b57542aeffc33a", "ja": "はい。なので、あなたの事で\n頭をいっぱいにするためにも……。", "zh": "是的。所以，为了让脑海里也全都是你的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1022_031tom", "source_sha256": "d749a9cfa45815ac81bda065295a048d88a6674c438610272627f8cfbfaeb7cf", "ja": "私に、{$P$}さんのことを\n教えてください～。どんなことでも結構ですよ～？", "zh": "请告诉我关于{$P$}先生的事情～。无论什么都可以哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1023_p", "source_sha256": "935e30e8c3faf5b42edc07cd20f1b85f3e7a374200c9d0e73742c0246691d787", "ja": "ざ、斬新だな……。\nしかし、俺の事と言っても……。", "zh": "真、真新奇啊……。\n不过，要说我的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1024_031tom", "source_sha256": "de1cf346dd3864d5af760230958805015791d4d0c9bece3bf1629157ea9c1468", "ja": "まさか、教えられないんですか～？\n私のことは、以前、あれこれ聞き出しましたよね～？", "zh": "难道说，您不能告诉我吗～？\n之前明明从我这里打听了各种事情对吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1025_031tom", "source_sha256": "0576413160329fab25c81455a1916a920fc6e3eb624035385d1ca9d7069e3136", "ja": "天空騎士団のことから、普段どんなふうに\n過ごしているのかといったことまで、根掘り葉掘り……", "zh": "从天空骑士团的事，到平时是怎么\n度过的之类的，问了个底朝天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1026_031tom", "source_sha256": "55e541473a972597f40150dab2491bceb911a683c493b863212128db67f2bbdd", "ja": "なのに、自分のこととなると、\n答えられないんですか～？", "zh": "明明是这样，轮到自己的事情时，反而答不上来了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1027_p", "source_sha256": "6ca2266e82760d50a3546d2f094c6579c6cc9b5f772350c77923d04decc17d7a", "ja": "わ、わかった！\n何でも答えるから……！", "zh": "我、我知道了！\n什么都会回答的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1028_031tom", "source_sha256": "0642a217c1164939ff62aef62c3c2e66052af63f8296836990d6bc3179314d9e", "ja": "ありがとうございます～。\nでは遠慮なく、聞かせてもらいましょう～。うふふ♪", "zh": "谢谢您～。\n那我就不客气，洗耳恭听了～。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1029_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1030_031tom", "source_sha256": "50e64194cff51d52405bea6627119371a711c9136ce4d83a880fdf04e76e5a88", "ja": "うふふ……{$P$}さんの個人情報が\n集まってしまいましたね～。", "zh": "呵呵……{$P$}先生的个人信息，\n都被收集过来了呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1031_p", "source_sha256": "405e04b0a1a1c274328052be19377c19ea424d8e3cd8971976f9a69585da9c6e", "ja": "ああ……まさか、こんなに\n色々聞かれるとは思わなかったよ……。", "zh": "啊……没想到会被问这么多事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1032_031tom", "source_sha256": "3e00ffa60afb81edcc8babec0e311ae1d337af80294c1ee0c6f6c2e7c21630d2", "ja": "もちろん、悪用はしませんよ～？\n……いい子にしていれば、ですが～。", "zh": "当然不会拿去做坏事啦～？\n……不过，前提是你要乖乖听话哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1033_p", "source_sha256": "62ae926777e91ba40ba78ce4eadef170a35b4ece93f0708d92bb07c8faaa4386", "ja": "ヒィッ！", "zh": "呜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1034_031tom", "source_sha256": "5895aaa5c1862bd084fee09f221ca6384e6ba6e4486edf58fcb7fc1df897e9ff", "ja": "これで準備も整ったことですし……\nさっそく、次の段階に進むことにしましょう～。", "zh": "这样一来准备工作也完成了……\n\n我们马上进入下一阶段吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1035_031tom", "source_sha256": "74f96a25483f6b21b677e1d313a5ac4c12f0801e7ae8684ed659f321ae36f74d", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n明日はお休みでしたよね～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n明天您休息对吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1036_p", "source_sha256": "6dd7ec9ee0b4cd2b8c13946d3cc62f7bc9aaff8e0c3792bc4ad5ca417fb7f250", "ja": "ああ、そうだけど……。", "zh": "啊，是这样没错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1037_031tom", "source_sha256": "7faca212e53fba0f672a21cc129cb97043770a930171ed2469bf713a5d816de7", "ja": "では……\n明日は、私とデートをしてください～。", "zh": "那么……\n明天请和我约会吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1038_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1039_p", "source_sha256": "f28bd272b37cc96a932494e6d6cfc59ac199319351d795d77f18910138a3eb8c", "ja": "朋花、お待たせ！", "zh": "朋花，让你久等了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1040_031tom", "source_sha256": "4424961d9ecb72d8a040d956a5de830f3d9544797c09038d1da1e05e4422d6b0", "ja": "{$P$}さん、おはようございます～。\n時間通りですね～。いい心がけですよ～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，早上好～\n很守时呢～值得表扬哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1041_p", "source_sha256": "a4c9f8b2a0679e5ec61f7318729b62374a6c6c55e0f103ee87f9e53de4c27a92", "ja": "あ、ああ。それにしても、\n意外な待ち合わせ場所だな……？", "zh": "啊、啊啊。不过话说回来，\n还真是个意外的碰头地点啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1042_031tom", "source_sha256": "7c2ceaa545138884c152dd617949e52323829a2aeff0b7dcf851a323412d47cc", "ja": "ええ、ウィンドウショッピングをしようと思いまして。\n流行を知るのも、アイドルの大切な仕事ですからね～。", "zh": "是的，我想去逛逛街，看看橱窗。\n了解流行趋势也是偶像的重要工作嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1043_p", "source_sha256": "f0b31e7556b8655e482143eb8e571f2583884249d0eedbf92c7d1030bdbca3c2", "ja": "それはそうだな。\n今週は、新譜が色々出ていたはず……。", "zh": "确实如此。\n这周应该出了不少新专辑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1044_tenin", "source_sha256": "beb238bc7da8fbf65e83110071bd2cedc3502cc8cc934873872fac189972581f", "ja": "と、朋花様！？　お疲れさまです！\nあの、見回りでしょうか……！？", "zh": "朋花大人！？辛苦了！\n那个，您是在巡视吗……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1046_031tom", "source_sha256": "21cbbf1b7d24c81e0bf8cfa9834f3dce4f96f41a832f065d63017443a2463742", "ja": "お疲れさまです～。ええ、そんなところですよ～。\nあなたも、お仕事しっかり励んでくださいね～。", "zh": "辛苦了～。嗯，差不多就是这样～。\n你也要好好努力工作哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1047_tenin", "source_sha256": "96fff839480b1abf5a7f829597775813d821707f985aa4e593fa4a3370fd8530", "ja": "は、はい、もちろんです！\n天空騎士団の名を汚さないよう、励みます！", "zh": "啊、好的，当然！\n为了不玷污天空骑士团之名，我会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1048_p", "source_sha256": "9715baa68668417fbc6a9d887525bc3c1c30c7322f0bf2ac98939dd3cd0eaa57", "ja": "（まさか、天空騎士団の人が働いているとは……。\nデートというより、挨拶回りに来たような感じだな）", "zh": "（没想到天空骑士团的人居然在这里工作……与其说是约会，感觉更像是来逐一打招呼的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1049_031tom", "source_sha256": "14b471ce79609acf1b950df4de7bcffc3c0aa52f3cd45d2120845dd620c6b797", "ja": "次は、流行の映画を見ますよ～。\nチケットはもう買ってありますからね～。", "zh": "接下来要去看最近很流行的电影哦～。\n票我已经买好了哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1050_p", "source_sha256": "472b85635d8ca700cbadec6ca3f726c94f7583d5580344ea84607c08204dd912", "ja": "おお、デートの定番だな！\nどれどれ……。", "zh": "哦哦，是约会的经典项目啊！\n我看看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1051_p", "source_sha256": "6adf88bd9b8676f2fd232d252de1c8b3d370b1ee758b4d969ba02555d9ee1f87", "ja": "もしかしてこれは、アイドルの話か……？", "zh": "难道说这是关于偶像的故事吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1052_031tom", "source_sha256": "eb358041309260703cf387d721da0ada7ab75a38f56b8ebb0eb55130a9226f4f", "ja": "ええ、参考になりそうですね～。\n見てみましょう～。", "zh": "嗯，感觉会很有参考价值呢～。\n我们来看看吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1054_031tom", "source_sha256": "f50a722188c15e7d14f37906a67b564ae57bd7298f5b50ccbfcd4107322f8f5d", "ja": "次は、ライブを見ますよ～。", "zh": "接下来要看演唱会啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1055_p", "source_sha256": "334b9f9633de8bfd2da8babed3206a0b84f4b61d8b3c33fd98058438873c31d3", "ja": "ライブ……これもアイドルなんだな。\nお客さん、結構入ってるな。", "zh": "演出……这也是偶像啊。\n客人还真不少。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1056_031tom", "source_sha256": "d3862864ac3479bd897807f6eaf453acc08a775301e7835af11ddb185636b1cf", "ja": "ええ。亜利沙さんイチオシの、\n新人アイドルちゃん、だそうですよ～。", "zh": "嗯。听说是亚利沙小姐最推荐的新人偶像哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1057_031tom", "source_sha256": "a506a84379614105dd0eb3a490d5a618d311b0896cbb0ad1688fc36ee9680af2", "ja": "小さなライブハウスですが、\nステージも見やすく、設備も整っていますね～。", "zh": "虽然是个小小的Livehouse，\n不过舞台视野很好，设备也很齐全呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1058_p", "source_sha256": "106fb1d77907cc67ecf3311fefe6fbaa8dba561cf1456e746be346174fabb973", "ja": "（見学……いや、視察……？）", "zh": "（参观……不，考察……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1059_031tom", "source_sha256": "417ce65bbf48e0075697cbdc671206903f5b8962d05282499f07571373d80de5", "ja": "お疲れさまです。これでデート体験は終わりですね～。\n{$P$}さん、どうでしたか～？", "zh": "辛苦了。这样一来，约会体验就结束了呢～  \n{$P$}先生，感觉怎么样～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1060_p", "source_sha256": "467fcb96ca85044cee42e48301d19a2eaf70aac91cd5475bfc75c3e86bf5eb74", "ja": "いや……なんだか、いつもの仕事と\nあまり変わらなかったような……。", "zh": "没有……总觉得和平时的工作\n好像也没什么两样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1061_031tom", "source_sha256": "dd88d01f830316e7f125897a86a557ee1df658b79a49e53bf46eb90d571b9f72", "ja": "あら……？\nそうでしたか～？", "zh": "哎呀……？\n是这样吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1062_p", "source_sha256": "b2a98dc0b08048da1feb2a98e6616dea25cb01d4673f1d0ff937772dab40eb54", "ja": "そもそも、どうしてデート体験する事に\nなったんだっけ……あ、そうか。", "zh": "说起来，最开始为什么会变成要体验约会来着……啊，对了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1063_p", "source_sha256": "0594f447f6e6b6987f0f0272d5be74f15a205bae2f2aa18d03239418f225f378", "ja": "朋花が、恋愛……恋する気持ちを知るためだったな。\nでも、この方法じゃ、ちょっと難しいかも……。", "zh": "朋花是为了了解恋爱……了解恋爱的感觉，才这么做的吧。\n不过，用这种方式，可能有点难……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1064_031tom", "source_sha256": "2bf2572a0d22c29d8db3b68fb17bc5e235408ce929368b9255799b2e0c9f126b", "ja": "……。\n何故ですか～？", "zh": "……\n为什么呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1065_p", "source_sha256": "cb7ffc4b8bed1d2e30a54c391338c8be7ad318054a391c2992b9872674340e5d", "ja": "だって朋花は、俺に恋してないじゃないか……。", "zh": "因为朋花根本就没有爱上我啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1067_p", "source_sha256": "badd89d19e32ff44b49ae11d284ba98dae666d89ae33a8b431747c598f80c0c8", "ja": "ドキドキするからデートをするのと、ドキドキしたい\nからデートをするのは、違うんじゃないかな……？", "zh": "因为心动才去约会，和想要心动所以去约会，应该是不一样的吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1068_p", "source_sha256": "97409e37863cf6dcaa5eea426a5b92753d97f39730ef03a580519ad2cbe532be", "ja": "もちろん、デートをしてみた結果、\nドキドキする事はあるだろうけど……。", "zh": "虽然要是实际约会了，\n也会有心跳加速的时候就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1069_031tom", "source_sha256": "b3523c5b554768b0318fd9ee0db735486fe4a736d07554cd1cf842bc20ecb4f6", "ja": "なるほど……？", "zh": "原来如此……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1070_p", "source_sha256": "743b7cb4c9539ebba7d52a90c170a708a4fb591dd5da8b6feee5cb87d85a0b6b", "ja": "というか、朋花はどうだったんだ？\nデート体験をしてみて……。", "zh": "话说回来，朋花感觉怎么样？\n体验过约会之后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1071_p", "source_sha256": "d1b720779f744db02240ac0472e83a492708f0842a321315ef4edca685630688", "ja": "アイドルが恋をする事……\nそれを否定する気持ちに、変わりはないか？", "zh": "偶像谈恋爱这件事……\n你否定这件事的态度，有改变吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1072_031tom", "source_sha256": "176eb2547d9ee94d21c3f26eaa0b3739960edf800ead6524ce6f3d4ec78ce89a", "ja": "そうですね……。\nやはり、裏切りではないか、と思ってしまいます～。", "zh": "是啊……\n我还是会觉得，这果然算是一种背叛吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1073_p", "source_sha256": "d7c49da16188fd2dcf4e1c681b92c01d444992a2996e87962c2acd1414714b25", "ja": "そうか……うん。\n確かに、そうかもしれない。でも……。", "zh": "这样啊……嗯。\n确实，也许是这样。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1074_p", "source_sha256": "2c616cd695ff02cb598bd58d801bbaa7b27334ceff9decc3b2801bd28127cd3c", "ja": "そういう、大切なファンを裏切るとわかっていても。\nそれでも捨てられないほどの気持ちがあるなら……。", "zh": "即使明知道那样会背叛重要的粉丝。\n如果还是有着无论如何都无法舍弃的感情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1075_p", "source_sha256": "f9607f8c4584eca8bac42d9347fc35c412f1981a45dc7c049735fa353409039e", "ja": "それは、すごく大事なことのような気がするんだ。\nいいか悪いかではなく。", "zh": "我觉得，那似乎是非常重要的事情。\n并不是说这样是对还是错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1077_p", "source_sha256": "c5fde4ee1f7aff27f82ba11599603ec92e13e59fc34eb6e19f48f553bd75f56e", "ja": "あとは……これを言ったら、本当は\n怒られるかもしれないんだけど……。", "zh": "还有……虽然说出这事的话，\n搞不好真的会被骂就是了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1078_031tom", "source_sha256": "62bf142bc1724199598ce8b8f7c70d768ac4950415709025fbfd9e3b4c28d2ea", "ja": "……？　なんですか～？", "zh": "……？是什么呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1079_p", "source_sha256": "564c750cb921280041856618e1c60120a239fdfe8a286ff61415030b9541c9c9", "ja": "どうせ恋をするなら、ファンを裏切ったという\nその気持ちごと、抱えていてほしい……。", "zh": "既然要谈恋爱，我希望你连同那份背叛了粉丝的心情，也一起背负着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1080_p", "source_sha256": "88a656e3f28f11e9ea7ba662a112ff14360c8c75029a2d4ea0a072664e45e7c4", "ja": "と、思っている。\n……あくまで、俺はだけど。", "zh": "我是这么想的。\n……不过，这只是我个人的想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1082_031tom", "source_sha256": "be64ec57f3661fc4ec19e8e8d1765a348d1371e7920c29ed0a195747be0a3fd0", "ja": "あなたという人は……\n何を言っているか、わかっているのですか～？", "zh": "你这个人啊……\n知道自己究竟在说些什么吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1083_031tom", "source_sha256": "d8b506d9034952ec56aaaeff92f451fdae372cf260810b309dfa966aa9eb6e5c", "ja": "それは……恋をしたアイドルに、罪悪感を抱えたまま、\nアイドルでいろ……ということですよ～？", "zh": "也就是说……要让一个坠入爱河的偶像，就这样怀着罪恶感继续当偶像……是这个意思吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1084_p", "source_sha256": "654f77b8522a260d64f9bc59c1244c45feeaea1464e847bc7e037adab0bf8b87", "ja": "そうだな。\nひどい事を言っているのかもしれないけど……。", "zh": "是啊。\n也许我说得有些过分……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1085_p", "source_sha256": "5b28c861d4d6a0b66dbc4277acd5db4b56b62ccdeb4dac0494f086c123d684f0", "ja": "でも、朋花が言うように……\nファンの人達の気持ちは、確かに存在している。", "zh": "不过，就像朋花说的……\n粉丝们的心意，确实是存在的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1086_p", "source_sha256": "caa8236961bb0450b36b77caeb6fb9ce6cc7d804e75c8775c75cde07662c422a", "ja": "それに、アイドルにとっては……恋する事すらも、\n自己を表現する手段のひとつにすぎないと思うんだ。", "zh": "而且，对偶像来说……就连恋爱，也不过是表达自我的一种方式而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1087_031tom", "source_sha256": "f42774bbade902959117532e25b9ab3ece6762d9ab0a30d0f8c904718ae2620e", "ja": "はぁ……まったく。こんな告解じみた言葉、\n他のみんなには、とても聞かせられませんね～。", "zh": "唉……真是的。这种像在告解一样的话，可实在不能让其他人听见呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1088_031tom", "source_sha256": "f0af08e19e34eb877541be1dece41c304b1856a7e6cc93287fa3b2b2a50f1847", "ja": "あなたのほうが、私よりよっぽど……。", "zh": "你比我可要……得多呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1089_p", "source_sha256": "77ba73dd8a0ab0e807dfa9afa0a970c2c4457f0ffbfea35f47c8cccba635c9b2", "ja": "ごめん。\nええと……呆れたか？", "zh": "对不起。  \n那个……你是不是觉得无语了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1090_031tom", "source_sha256": "d2a8b09064dea65c0a0f04abf472f1d9af7e2e3248715ae0ebc91fc94c7dc432", "ja": "……いいえ。\n呆れてはいませんが……。", "zh": "……没有。\n我倒没有觉得无奈，只是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1091_031tom", "source_sha256": "23f77a87a29a92d270bd82258edcecd41deb434dc02e85f83182984b51bc6b37", "ja": "私は今、あなたのことが……\nようやく、すこしだけわかった気がしますよ～。", "zh": "我现在……\n感觉自己终于稍微明白你了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1092_p", "source_sha256": "75cd68d9c34f6940e372d85dee8dca535999c3a61c1dac7ef78538ad76da6436", "ja": "（こうして、朋花のデート体験は終わった。\n恋をするかしないかは、彼女自身が決める事……）", "zh": "（就这样，朋花的约会体验结束了。\n要不要恋爱，是由她自己决定的事……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_140_1093_p", "source_sha256": "4ae95ecfb6161d6a05ec3b44224df3edd7896cfb776f05a78a486e94af809920", "ja": "（そして、朋花がどんな答えを出したとしても。\n俺がプロデューサーである事に変わりはないんだ）", "zh": "（而且，无论朋花最后给出怎样的答案，我都是制作人这一点不会改变。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
